cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite Version 0.1.0 of this research repository."
title: "The smallest singular value of a sparse Mertens matrix"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Kline
    given-names: Jeffery
repository-code: "https://github.com/jeff-kline/sparse-mertens-singular-values"
url: "https://github.com/jeff-kline/sparse-mertens-singular-values"
license: GPL-3.0-only
abstract: >-
  A proof and verification repository for unconditional two-sided bounds on
  the smallest singular value of a sparse Mertens matrix, a two-sided
  singular-value criterion equivalent to the Riemann hypothesis, and endpoint
  estimates for the modified matrix and its triangular factor.
keywords:
  - Mertens function
  - singular values
  - Redheffer matrix
  - Riemann hypothesis
  - Moebius function
  - Dickman function
